  "title": "Qt: Use the common hoverBackground on ProtoTree with Windows",
  "description": "Similar to 76c83894a641ba15e513564bed6c42fb2e59dc02\n\nIME, the Windows default hover color is very light in Light mode, and\nindistinguishable in Dark mode. This gives better contrast in both modes, and\nis the same default as what the Packet List already does. (Whether the\nProto Tree should use the color preferences for non default selected\nand hovered items that the Packet List does is another question.)\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
